{"id":"612204","name":"苏格兰蛋","author":"花花的风味","authorId":"6549068","desc":"","cover":"images/612204/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"8个"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"300g"},{"name":"藕","amount":"1个"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1/4个"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面包糠","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"六个室温鸡蛋，开水下锅煮5分钟，锅中放少许盐和白醋。","img":"images/612204/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋捞出，放入冰水6分钟。","img":"images/612204/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"然后剥壳。","img":"images/612204/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"肉末加一个鸡蛋和调味，切藕、洋葱放入肉末。","img":"images/612204/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取个小碗（磨具）先铺薄膜，再放肉馅。","img":"images/612204/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋放入。","img":"images/612204/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再在蛋上加些肉末，包起来。","img":"images/612204/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"都包好后，放冰箱冷藏20分钟。","img":"images/612204/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"然后拿出来，先裹面粉、鸡蛋液、面包糠。","img":"images/612204/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"低温下油锅。","img":"images/612204/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"看颜色微黄就好了。","img":"images/612204/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切开，看到是溏心蛋，很开心。成功了，味道也很好👍。","img":"images/612204/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}